# Destinations a build sandbox may reach, one extended regular expression per
# line matched against the request host. FilterDefaultDeny makes this an
# allowlist: a host absent from here is refused, so a repository-declared
# `<repositories>` entry cannot send the build somewhere else.
^repo\.maven\.apache\.org$
^repo1\.maven\.org$
^plugins\.gradle\.org$
^services\.gradle\.org$
^downloads\.gradle\.org$
